{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303111","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303111","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430311101:1":{"text":"뭐라고 설명해야 할까... 난 거의 의식을 잃을 정도로 아팠거든.","source_cn":"这很难形容……当时的我已经病到意识模糊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DEC922CAD0DECCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430311102:1":{"text":"정신없는 와중에 무언가를 마셨던 것 같아... 그리고 깨어나보니 다 나았어.","source_cn":"恍惚间我好像喝了什么……之后醒来时，我就已经恢复。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5947516CEB4A8A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430311103:1":{"text":"그리고 내 옆에는 제사장님이 여왕님께 기도를 하고 계셨지!","source_cn":"而那位祭司正站在我身边，正在向女王祷告。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B3C194E0181A351","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族法芙":{"text":"귀족 파프","source":"贵族法芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族恩特":{"text":"귀족 언트","source":"贵族恩特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}